---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Statement | Hustle & Rise" description="How Hustle & Rise handles information when you browse the website, contact us, or follow an external link.">
  <section class="legal-page px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8"><article class="prose prose-lg mx-auto max-w-4xl prose-headings:font-brand prose-headings:font-extrabold prose-headings:text-[#172033] prose-p:text-[#566071] prose-p:leading-8 prose-li:text-[#566071]"><p class="section-eyebrow">Trust & transparency</p><h1>Privacy statement</h1><p><strong>Last updated: 16 August 2026</strong></p><h2>What the current website collects</h2><p>Hustle & Rise does not currently provide user accounts, a newsletter form, payments, or an on-site contact form. We do not intentionally collect personal information through those features.</p><p>If you email us, we receive the information you choose to send, such as your name, email address, message, and attachments. We use it to respond, handle corrections or enquiries, and maintain necessary correspondence.</p><h2>Saved jobs and browser storage</h2><p>The “Save this job” feature stores only the identifiers of jobs you select in your browser’s local storage. That shortlist stays on the device and browser where you saved it; Hustle & Rise does not receive it, associate it with an account, or synchronise it to a server. You can remove individual jobs through their save buttons, use “Clear all” on the saved-jobs page, or clear this website’s storage through your browser settings.</p><h2>Technical information</h2><p>Website hosting and security providers may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, requested page, date, and time to deliver and protect the site. The current site does not install first-party analytics or advertising cookies. If that changes, this statement and any required consent controls will be updated before collection begins.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>The site loads web fonts and links to job providers, social-sharing services, and other external websites. Those providers may receive standard request information and apply their own privacy statements when you visit them.</p><h2>Storage and disclosure</h2><p>We keep correspondence only as long as reasonably needed for its purpose, record-keeping, security, or legal obligations. We do not sell personal information. We may use service providers to operate email or hosting, or disclose information when required by law.</p><h2>Your choices and rights</h2><p>You may ask what personal information we hold about you and request a correction. You can also ask us to delete correspondence where no legal or operational reason requires retention.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For a privacy request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. Include enough detail for us to identify and respond to the request, but do not send unnecessary sensitive information.</p></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
